&lt;p&gt;An R package to build and simulate coalescent models for population
genetic and demographic inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coalescent simulation via msABC and scrm backends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ABC rejection and neural network (SML) inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shiny GUI for model building and visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for RADseq and whole-genome sequence data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/gehara/PipeMaster"&gt;GitHub Repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>